---
description: Media and R2 storage visibility rules
globs: lib/storage/**/*,features/media/**/*
alwaysApply: false
---

# Media Storage

- Bucket `architak-media` is private by default
- Every key starts with `public/` or `private/`
- Refuse mismatched visibility vs prefix
- Public CDN (`R2_PUBLIC_BASE_URL`) serves `public/` only
- Private objects: short-lived signed URLs only
- Do not bind custom domain to expose the whole bucket
